OL,3,AJurors in Lindsay Clancy trial
OL,4,Adeadlocked but judge asks them to keep
OL,5,Atrying
OL,6,
OL,7,FJurors in the trial of Lindsay Clancy
OL,8,Fare deadlocked after four days of
OL,9,Fdeliberations, but a judge has asked
OL,10,Fthem to keep trying.
OL,12,FClancy, a resident of Massachusetts, is
OL,13,Ffacing murder charges for killing her
OL,14,Fthree children at their family home in
OL,15,F2023.
OL,17,FHer lawyer does not dispute that the
OL,18,F36-year-old former nurse killed the
OL,19,Fchildren, but argues that she was
OL,20,Fsuffering from postpartum psychosis at
OL,21,Fthe time and was unable to distinguish
OL,22,Fright from wrong.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
