OL,3,AJurors in Lindsay Clancy trial
OL,4,Adeadlocked but judge asks them to keep
OL,5,Atrying
OL,6,
OL,7,FAfter discussing the case for several
OL,8,Fmore hours on Tuesday, jurors were sent
OL,9,Fhome for the day and asked to return in
OL,10,Fthe morning.
